WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:01.599
Speaker 1: David, is it true that Donald Trump
wore his pants backwards at that crazy speech

00:00:01.599 --> 00:00:02.599
in North Carolina?

00:00:02.599 --> 00:00:03.599
It is not true.

00:00:03.599 --> 00:00:04.599
But listen, I understand what's going on.

00:00:04.599 --> 00:00:05.599
Trump came up to the stage and we're going
to show a picture of it.

00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:06.599
And his pants just looked strange.

00:00:06.599 --> 00:00:07.599
There were weird creases on the front.

00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:08.599
It almost looked like there were like there
was no zipper, like there was just a seam.

00:00:08.599 --> 00:00:09.599
And there was speculation his pants were backwards
or it was some kind of a mermaid outfit or

00:00:09.599 --> 00:00:10.599
he was wearing an elastic waistband.

00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:11.599
And that's why there was no zipper.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:12.599
I have to tell you, when I looked at it closely,
the wrinkles looked like Trump had just been

00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:13.599
sitting and the pants are wrinkly.

00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:14.599
And I do see what looks like a zipper crease,
although it's not as noticeable maybe as some

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:15.599
others would, I would imagine it to be.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.599
And I didn't for a second think that Donald
Trump wore his pants backwards.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:17.599
This was then looked at by Snopes and Snopes
did indeed determine no, Trump did not wear

00:00:17.599 --> 00:00:18.599
his pants backward at the rally you asked.

00:00:18.599 --> 00:00:19.599
So we watched the 90 minute speech and they
found that the photograph simply do not show

00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:20.599
that Trump's pants were backwards.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:21.599
Now, it's the funny thing to me about this
is, first of all, the idea that we many of

00:00:21.599 --> 00:00:22.599
us would believe that Trump might wear his
pants backwards like that wouldn't be beyond

00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:23.599
the realm of possibility.

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:24.599
I would believe it.

00:00:24.599 --> 00:00:25.599
It just happened not to have been the case.

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:26.599
But the more interesting thing was how low
is the bar that a lot of the commentary is,

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:27.599
including my own on Twitter, when when I saw
this were essentially lizanne, the speech

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:28.599
was deranged.

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:29.599
Trump lied throughout it.

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:30.599
He told corrosive lies about democracy.

00:00:30.599 --> 00:00:31.599
He did all of these things, but his pants
weren't on backwards.

00:00:31.599 --> 00:00:32.599
And I think it was Lucas Grindley from The
Advocate, if I recall correctly, who responded

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.599
to me and said, this is how low the bar now
is, that we can say at least the guy's pants

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:34.599
were on straight, but no, his pants were forward.

00:00:34.599 --> 00:00:35.599
I don't really care about Donald Trump's clothing.

00:00:35.599 --> 00:00:36.599
I've never understood from a very just practical
perspective, a guy as wealthy as Trump claims

00:00:36.599 --> 00:00:37.599
to be or as wealthy as Trump is.

00:00:37.599 --> 00:00:38.599
They're not the same thing, but he's still
a wealthy guy.

00:00:38.599 --> 00:00:39.599
How has no one gone to him and said, sir,
the full seat suit look is not in right now.

00:00:39.599 --> 00:00:40.599
The tailored, slimmer fit looks and or maybe
they have.

00:00:40.599 --> 00:00:41.599
And Trump doesn't look right in the slimmer
fit suits.

00:00:41.599 --> 00:00:42.599
I've never understood how a guy this wealthy
has such terrible suits, but I know that Trump's

00:00:42.599 --> 00:00:43.599
an older guy and that's a style that there
are other older men I know who still like

00:00:43.599 --> 00:00:44.599
the full seat suit.

00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:45.599
And that appears to be Trump.

00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:46.599
But his pants were on forward as far as we
can tell.

00:00:46.599 --> 00:00:47.599
David, now that we know more about the UFO
UAP revelations over the last month, are you

00:00:47.599 --> 00:00:48.599
ready to say that the UFOs aren't aliens from
another planet?

00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:49.599
Yeah, I mean, here's the thing.

00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:50.599
I don't know how many times I have to say
this.

00:00:50.599 --> 00:00:51.599
I've been asked this so many times when we
talk about an unidentified flying object or

00:00:51.599 --> 00:00:52.599
a UAP.

00:00:52.599 --> 00:00:53.599
We aren't implying that the default would
be if we aren't aware of what a thing is,

00:00:53.599 --> 00:00:54.599
it's aliens from another planet.

00:00:54.599 --> 00:00:55.599
And so after the 60 Minutes interview came
out with these claims about these UAP UFOs

00:00:55.599 --> 00:00:56.599
that pilots had seen and some of the documents
that the government has released, and the

00:00:56.599 --> 00:00:57.599
indication was we don't know what this is
because it doesn't match anything that is

00:00:57.599 --> 00:00:58.599
ours.

00:00:58.599 --> 00:01:00.551
And it's appearing to defy some of the constraints
of the physical world as we understand it,

00:01:00.551 --> 00:01:02.010
and so on and so forth.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:10.070
My first explanation isn't these are aliens
that came from somewhere else and nobody else

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.369
saw them arrive.

00:01:11.369 --> 00:01:14.860
No other planet, no other country saw them
arrive to the planet.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:18.250
But then our military pilots see, I don't
go to that.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:23.460
The simplest explanations to me include some
aspect of this was distorted by the way that

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:29.590
it was filmed, which is one area of of study
that is being looked at and the idea that

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:33.340
certain camera lenses can make things look
as though they are moving in ways and that

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:36.210
speeds in which they actually aren't.

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:37.659
That's one aspect.

00:01:37.659 --> 00:01:45.869
The other aspect would be these are foreign
elements of some kind from an adversary.

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:50.450
And so we are not.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.479
We're being given limited information and
these this is say, you know, surveillance

00:01:55.479 --> 00:02:03.850
of some kind from a from an adversary, the
third possibility would be this is U.S. stuff

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:09.540
that is so highly classified that what the
government has decided to do is to allow the

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:14.760
pilots to come out and say what they did,
but not go any further and just claim this

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:20.470
is not stuff the U.S. government is at least
publicly taking credit for when it actually

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:22.940
is some classified government program.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:27.680
And then the fourth possibility, and this
is this is like the cynical one in some sense,

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:33.780
is that this is all a disinformation campaign
to make other countries see this stuff and

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:38.860
go, oh, man, is this do they have this at
the in the United States?

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:43.370
Is are these actually technologies that the
U.S. has we are way behind.

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:45.470
Let's try to reverse engineer this, for example.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:50.560
And the idea is a disinformation campaign
to send other countries on a wild goose chase

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.500
to stuff that's simply CGI.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:58.480
All of those possibilities strike me as far
more likely.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.550
Again, just an Occam's razor.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:02.980
What requires the fewest assumptions?

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:08.670
Those all strike me as far more likely than
these are aliens from some other part of the

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.990
universe that have visited us.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:15.900
When I sort of said this is my position a
couple of weeks ago, I got 99 percent emails

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.820
from people saying, David, thank you.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:18.820
This just makes sense.

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:23.440
This seems like the most plausible way to
understand what we've seen and a few people

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:27.800
saying, David, obviously these are aliens
from another planet and everybody's in on

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.650
the cover up and you're a part of being in
on the cover up.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:34.270
Again, that requires lots of assumptions and
complexity.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:39.910
So I tend to lean towards the simpler explanations
now for people who will write to me and say,

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.970
David, do you think that there are aliens?

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:50.610
I think that statistically it's likely there
is intelligent life elsewhere in the universe

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.390
other than Earth.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:55.960
I just don't think this is it arriving.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.480
Call me crazy.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.480
Let me know your thoughts.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:05:04.040
That's my best guess as to what this is as
of right now.

